.turbo/

# Testing
coverage/

# Lighthouse CI reports (tooling/lighthouse-ci)
lhci-reports/
.lighthouseci/

# Playwright (tooling/e2e) — .auth/ holds real session storageState, never
# committed. Matched with **/ (not a fixed path) as a safety net: a wrong
# relative path in playwright.config.ts once put a real one two directories
# deeper than expected, past a path-specific ignore rule.
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/.auth/
**/blob-report/

